    <string name="pinning_dialog_title">How to pin this app</string>
    <string name="pinning_dialog_message">1. Open the device Settings and find Security (on some devices it is under Security and privacy, or Lock screen).\n\n2. Turn on App pinning. Also turn on the option to ask for a PIN or lock pattern before unpinning.\n\n3. Open Little Videos, then go to the app switcher (the recent apps screen).\n\n4. Tap the app icon at the top of the Little Videos card and choose Pin.\n\nTo unpin, follow the on-screen gesture and enter your device PIN.</string>

